SUMMARY:Refusing to Rest: The Books and Prints of Amos Paul Kennedy Jr.
DESCRIPTION:Kennedy prints beautiful posters with famous quotes\, motivat
 ional and provocative messages\, and event advertisements by using colorf
 ul layers of text. His technique is also present in his books\, where he 
 uses quotes in conjunction with textiles\, images\, and colorful paper to
  explore literary works\, social injustices against Black Americans\, and
  African proverbs and riddles. &#160\;  Feel free to drop in as your sche
 dule permits!&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Kennedy prints beautiful posters with f
 amous quotes\, motivational and provocative messages\, and event advertis
 ements by using colorful layers of text. His technique is also present in
  his books\, where he uses quotes in conjunction with textiles\, images\,
  and colorful paper to explore literary works\, social injustices against
  Black Americans\, and African proverbs and riddles. &#160\;</p><p>  Feel
  free to drop in as your schedule permits!&#160\;</p>
