DESCRIPTION:Did you know you can spend a semester or summer living\, inte
 rning\, and building a professional network in Washington\, D.C. through 
 the Hamilton Lugar School?  Whether you are actively planning your applic
 ation for Spring or Summer 2027 or just curious about how an HLS D.C. exp
 erience fits your degree\, drop in&#160\;for a fast-tracked 15-minute tun
 e-up session.  In Just 15 Minutes:Free Professional Headshot for LinkedIn
 \, Handshake &amp\; applications  Resume Feedback geared toward internshi
 ps\, government\, NGOs &amp\; policy careers    D.C. Program Match with t
 he HLS Washington\, D.C. Global Policy Program (https://hls.indiana.edu/c
 areers/dc-global-policy-program/index.html) – explore how this opportun
 ity opens doors to high-impact internships and career networks in the nat
 ion's capital.      Claim Your Spot:Reserve Time Slot: Complete the regis
 tration form and lock in your 15-minute appointment block:    Registratio
 n Form:https://forms.gle/1zckFZ1t1BNe1gW6A (https://forms.gle/1zckFZ1t1BN
 e1gW6A)Bring Printed Resume: You must bring 1 hard copy of your resume dr
 aft for on-the-spot red-pen feedback.    Dress Waist-Up Professional: Wea
 r a professional top\, collared shirt\, or blazer (headshots are framed w
 aist-up).    Check In: Arrive 5 minutes early to the check-in desk outsid
 e room HLSRoom 2134.
